I hope to share with you some of the best practices of how to use evals to drive development of agentic workflows.

42
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:09,820
Look forward to seeing you in the next module.

43
00:05:09,820 --> 00:05:09,940
from the first to have the future.

44
